# The PAPER setting, set to LETTER in the setup menu as a user does it, gives
# Letter pages: our ESC/P pages (PRFILES, as in pages-escp) become three
# 8.5 x 11 inch pages, the pixels the host test draws on Letter
# (tools/printer/golden/TEXT.PRN.letter.pages and GRAPH.PRN.letter.pages),
# and the PDF is the one tools/printer/render --letter writes for the same
# bytes (make_bench_disks.sh's escp-expected-letter.pdf).
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
type put_str PAPER LETTER
key 0x1c
type save
key 0x1c
key s
key 0x1c
type print
key 0x1c
text "PAPER .STR.: LETTER" 300
key m
key 0x1c
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 300
key f
key 0x1c
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
key 0x39
log "pages: job 00000001 page 1 2040x2376 MD5 9e494fbc20857102c03fd4e7ac4f2040" 3000
log "pages: job 00000001 page 2 2040x2376 MD5 5cde665dbad854204f40ccbc5408a688" 600
log "pages: job 00000001 page 3 2040x2376 MD5 2d2b54e5aa6d4360d5db447a8c3359f9" 600
log "pages: job 00000001 rendered, 3 pages, PDF 31757 bytes" 600
cardsame PRINTER/00000001.pdf tools/dev/builds/disks/escp-expected-letter.pdf
